# ===== Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest (36 steps, 6 chapters) =============================================
prop hens creature.count=4
prop goats creature.count=3
prop turtles creature.count=2
prop dolphins creature.count=3
prop vultures creature.zone=derailment

info title=Sundown Canyons
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A red-rock island of canyons and mesas: the town of Sundown on its shore, a ranch on the plain, a silver train derailed in the canyon, a mine with a lift through Black Mesa - and on the mesa's top, the outlaw fort where the gang took the town's silver and the bank's key. The sheriff rode after them and didn't come back. Her badge is on the desk.
island on.arrive=message||A town of false fronts and boardwalks under red canyons. The saloon's doors swing in the wind. Somewhere up in the rocks, dogs howl - a lot of dogs.

story sheriffkey|Sheriff's key ring|quest:Utopia_KeyPrison|Sheriff Brennan's key ring: the jail, the gun locker.
story dynamite|Stick of dynamite|quest:Vasagatan_Bomb|A stick of the railroad's blasting powder, its fuse still dry.
story silverbar|Silver bar|MetalIngot|A bar of Sundown's silver, stamped with the bank's mark.
story liftkey|Mine lift key|quest:Varuna_MotherlodeKey|The Lucky Strike's lift key, from the foreman's strongbox.
story vaultkey|Bank vault key|quest:Caravan_KeyMayor|The Bank of Sundown's vault key, from the gang's loot chest.
story allclear|Signal fire|Placeable_Lantern_FireBasket|The fire is lit on Black Mesa: the town knows the gang is gone.
story receipt|Bank receipt|quest:Utopia_DettoCode|The teller's receipt: six silver bars, PAID IN FULL.

note sheriffreport Sheriff's last report | SUNDOWN - SHERIFF'S REPORT\n\nThe Black Mesa gang hit the silver train in the canyon on the 3rd. Derailed her at the bend, blew the express safe (half of it), blew the trestle behind them so the posse couldn't follow, and took the rest up to their fort on Black Mesa.\n\nThey rustled the Double Bar's llamas on the way - three got loose in the box canyon behind the ranch.\n\nThe bank's vault key was on the train for the new branch. Clem Harlan has it now.\n\nI'm riding up after them. My keys are in the desk drawer; the gun locker's yours if you need it.\n\nWhoever wears this badge next: get the town's silver back to the bank.\n- A. Brennan, Sheriff
note wantedposter Wanted poster | WANTED\n\nCLEM HARLAN and the BLACK MESA GANG\n\nfor train robbery, rustling, and the blowing of the Red Rock trestle.\n\nReward from the Bank of Sundown.\nBEWARE THE GANG'S HOUNDS.
note rancherletter Rancher's letter | To the sheriff, or whoever reads this:\n\nThe gang ran off with my llamas - three got loose in the box canyon behind the house. Net them - the net launcher's in the barn's tack chest - and my strongbox is yours to open.\n\nThere's a map in it of the gang's trail: through the old Lucky Strike mine. Its lift goes clean up through Black Mesa to their back door.\n\n- W. Pruett, Double Bar ranch
note engineerlog Engineer's log | SUNDOWN & RED ROCK LINE - ENGINE No. 4\n\n3rd. Logs across the line at the bend. Hit them at speed. Express car over.\n\nThe gang blew the express safe but only got one drawer - two bars are still in there. They took two more across the trestle and blew it under themselves; the strongbox went into the river. The rest went up the mesa.\n\nThey cleaned out the tool car's powder - nearly. One stick left under the seat. There's more at the section house up the line.\n\nAda went after them alone.\n- S. Tull, engineer
note tallyboard Foreman's tally board | LUCKY STRIKE - TALLY\n\nTons this month: 12. Men: 9.\nBears in the lower gallery: 1. DON'T.\n\nThe lift to the top of the mesa is locked. Key's in my strongbox. Lost the strongbox's own key down the shaft - use powder on it, it's only a box.
note gangledger Gang's ledger | BLACK MESA - CLEM'S LEDGER\n\nSilver train: 6 bars. Left 2 in the safe (fools). Lost 2 in the river when the bridge went. 2 here.\nLlamas: 6, 3 got away.\nSheriff's horse: 1.\nSheriff: (crossed out, hard)\nThe bank's key: in the chest.\n\nWatch the town for smoke.
note proclamation Mayor's proclamation | PROCLAMATION\n\nThe Black Mesa gang is gone! The town of Sundown thanks whoever lit the fire on the mesa.\n\nBring the silver to the bank and the vault is yours to open, by order of the Mayor - and the badge too, if you'll have it.
note managerletter Bank manager's letter | To the next sheriff:\n\nThe vault holds the town's trust - deeds, plans, coin, the mayor's hat (don't ask). Return the silver at the counter and the vault is yours to open, to keep for us.\n\n- J. Whitlock, Bank of Sundown
note sheriffdrawer Sheriff's desk drawer | The sheriff's desk drawer: a box of cartridges, a photograph, and her key ring.
loot sheriffdrawer story:sheriffkey*1;Rope*2
prop sheriffdrawer loot.refill=0
note gunlocker Sheriff's gun locker | The jail's gun locker: a bow and a quiver of iron arrows, a spear, a leather vest.
loot gunlocker Bow*1;Arrow_Metal*12;Spear_Scrap*1;Equipment_LeatherChest*1
prop gunlocker loot.refill=0
prop gunlocker if.open=has|story:sheriffkey|1
prop gunlocker else.open=message||The gun locker is locked. The sheriff's keys are in her desk drawer.
note tackchest Barn tack chest | The barn's tack chest: halters, a saddle blanket - and the ranch's net launcher with its canisters.
loot tackchest NetGun*1;NetCanister*6;Rope*3
prop tackchest loot.refill=0
note rancherbox Rancher's strongbox | Walt Pruett's strongbox: his thanks in coin, a llama carved in wood - and a map of the gang's trail, through the Lucky Strike and up its lift to the mesa's top.
loot rancherbox TradeToken*6;Placeable_Figurine_Llama*1;Leather*3
prop rancherbox loot.refill=0
prop rancherbox if.open=quest|9
prop rancherbox else.open=message||Walt's strongbox. His letter said: net the llamas in the box canyon first - then it's yours.
prop rancherbox on.open=journal|The gang's trail|Walt's map: from the derailment, up the switchbacks to the Lucky Strike mine in the canyon wall. Its lift runs up through Black Mesa to the gang's back door. The lift's key is in the foreman's strongbox.
note toolcar Tool car box | The tool car's box, under the seat: spikes, a hammer - and one stick of dynamite the gang missed.
loot toolcar story:dynamite*1;Nail*8
prop toolcar loot.refill=0
note sectionhouse Section house box | The section gang's box in the hut by the line: a lamp, a jug - and a stick of dynamite.
loot sectionhouse story:dynamite*1;BioFuel*1
prop sectionhouse loot.refill=0
note expresssafe Express car safe | The express car's safe, its lid blown off at last: two bars of silver the gang left behind.
loot expresssafe story:silverbar*2;TradeToken*3
prop expresssafe loot.refill=0
prop expresssafe if.open=quest|14\ntake|story:dynamite|1
prop expresssafe else.open=message||The express safe's one drawer is blown open and empty; the rest is shut tight. A stick of dynamite would do it.
prop expresssafe on.open=sound||event:/weapons/dynamite/explode\nmessage||BOOM. When the dust settles, the safe's door hangs by one hinge.
note fallenbox Fallen strongbox | The strongbox the gang dropped when the trestle went, on the riverbed: two silver bars.
loot fallenbox story:silverbar*2;Scrap*2
prop fallenbox loot.refill=0
note foremanbox Foreman's strongbox | The foreman's strongbox, its lock blown: the lift key, the month's pay, a map of the galleries.
loot foremanbox story:liftkey*1;TradeToken*4;MetalOre*3
prop foremanbox loot.refill=0
prop foremanbox if.open=quest|21\ntake|story:dynamite|1
prop foremanbox else.open=message||The foreman's strongbox, locked. His board said: use powder on it.
prop foremanbox on.open=sound||event:/weapons/dynamite/explode\nmessage||BOOM. The lock is gone, and so are your eyebrows.
note gangloot Gang's loot chest | The gang's loot chest: two bars of the town's silver, a fistful of coin - and the Bank of Sundown's vault key.
loot gangloot story:silverbar*2;story:vaultkey*1;TradeToken*5
prop gangloot loot.refill=0
note bankvault Bank vault | The Bank of Sundown's vault: the town's trust - deeds, the telegraph office's charger plans, the carpenter's patterns, a machine for turning scrap back into iron, coin, and yes, the mayor's hat.
loot bankvault Blueprint_BatteryCharger*1;Blueprint_DetailPlank*1;Blueprint_Recycler*1;Hat_Mayor*1;TradeToken*30;MetalIngot*10
prop bankvault loot.refill=0
prop bankvault if.open=has|story:receipt|1
prop bankvault else.open=message||The vault's inner lock answers to the teller's receipt. Return the silver at the counter first.
note wharfcrate Wharf crate | A crate on the wharf: nails, rope, canned beans.
loot wharfcrate Nail*10;Rope*3;Cooked_GenericMeat*2
prop wharfcrate loot.refill=0
note saloonbox Saloon box | The saloon's box on the porch: glasses, a deck of cards, a jar of pickled eggs.
loot saloonbox Glass*3;Egg*2;Plank*4
prop saloonbox loot.refill=0
note storebox General store box | The store's box: flour, salt, tobacco, a bolt of cloth.
loot storebox Wool*3;Raw_Potato*3;Rope*2
prop storebox loot.refill=0
note stationbox Station box | The station's box: timetables, a lantern, a coil of telegraph wire.
loot stationbox CopperIngot*2;Placeable_Lantern_Metal*1;Scrap*2
prop stationbox loot.refill=0
note ranchpantry Ranch pantry | The ranch pantry: jerky, beans, a jar of honey.
loot ranchpantry Cooked_GenericMeat*3;Jar_Honey*1;Raw_Beet*2
prop ranchpantry loot.refill=0
note mailsack Mail sack | The train's mail sack, split open: letters, a parcel of tools.
loot mailsack Bolt*4;Hinge*2;Nail*6
prop mailsack loot.refill=0
note riverbarrel River barrel | A barrel on the riverbed under the trestle: railroad spikes, scrap.
loot riverbarrel Scrap*4;MetalOre*2;Nail*6
prop riverbarrel loot.refill=0
note minecache Mine cache | A miner's cache deep in the gallery: candles, ore, a flask.
loot minecache MetalOre*4;CopperOre*2;BioFuel*1
prop minecache loot.refill=0
note tentbox Gang's tent box | A box in the gang's tent: playing cards, a mouth organ, beef jerky.
loot tentbox Cooked_GenericMeat*2;Leather*2;Feather*3
prop tentbox loot.refill=0

prop windmill beh.spin=60
prop liftcage obj.name=liftcage
prop liftcage beh.use=Unlock the lift and ride it up
prop liftcage if.use=has|story:liftkey|1
prop liftcage on.use=message||The key turns, the cage shudders and climbs - up through the dark heart of the mesa, rock sliding past the bars, for a long minute - and stops in daylight.\nteleport|mesalift\nsound||event:/exploring/utopia/lift_pull
prop liftcage else.use=message||The lift cage is padlocked to its track. The tally board said the key is in the foreman's strongbox.
prop mesalift obj.name=mesalift
prop signalfire obj.name=signalfire
prop signalfire beh.use=Light the signal fire
prop signalfire if.use=quest|27
prop signalfire on.use=message||The fire basket roars up. Far below, in Sundown, a bell starts ringing - and a rider leaves town, heading for the foot of the mesa.\nshow|signalflame\nshow|homeward\nshow|proclamation\ngive||story:allclear*1\nsound||event:/crafting/torch
prop signalfire else.use=message||A signal fire, laid and ready. Not yet - the gang's loot first.
prop signalflame obj.name=signalflame
prop signalflame beh.hidden=1
prop homeward obj.name=homeward
prop homeward beh.hidden=1
prop proclamation obj.name=proclamation
prop proclamation beh.hidden=1
prop teller obj.name=teller
prop teller beh.use=Return the six silver bars
prop teller if.use=quest|33\ntake|story:silverbar|6
prop teller on.use=message||The teller's scale clanks down under the silver, bar after bar. A rubber stamp: PAID IN FULL. The receipt is yours.\ngive||story:receipt*1\nsound||event:/exploring/shop/sell
prop teller else.use=message||The teller's counter. The town's silver was six bars - all six, please.
prop vaultdoor obj.name=vaultdoor
prop vaultdoor beh.use=Unlock the vault door
prop vaultdoor beh.turn=-95
prop vaultdoor beh.moveTime=2
prop vaultdoor beh.moveMode=switch
prop vaultdoor if.use=has|story:vaultkey|1
prop vaultdoor on.use=message||The gang's key fits the vault's padlock. The heavy door swings open.\nopen|vaultdoor\nsound||event:/raft/door/door_unlock_key
prop vaultdoor else.use=message||The vault door's padlock. Its key went up Black Mesa with the gang.

prop wharf zone.id=wharf
prop wharf zone.radius=8
prop wharf zone.message=Sundown's wharf. Main street runs up from it: a saloon, a jail, a bank with its blinds down.
prop ranch zone.id=ranch
prop ranch zone.radius=12
prop ranch zone.message=The Double Bar ranch: the corral gate open, the corral empty, a letter weighed down with a horseshoe on the table.
prop boxcanyon zone.id=boxcanyon
prop boxcanyon zone.radius=12
prop boxcanyon zone.message=The box canyon - and three llamas, looking at you as if this is all your fault.
prop station zone.id=station
prop station zone.radius=8
prop station zone.message=Sundown station. The rails run off up the canyon. No train has come down them since the 3rd.
prop derailment zone.id=derailment
prop derailment zone.radius=12
prop derailment zone.message=The silver train, on its side in the canyon: wagons spilled, the express car over, logs across the line.
prop trestlezone zone.id=trestle
prop trestlezone zone.radius=12
prop trestlezone zone.message=The trestle, blown in the middle, the river green and deep below - and something long moving in it.
prop minezone zone.id=mine
prop minezone zone.radius=8
prop minezone zone.message=The Lucky Strike: a timbered mouth, a tally board, and from the lower gallery a growl.
prop mesatopzone zone.id=mesatop
prop mesatopzone zone.radius=6
prop mesatopzone zone.message=The top of Black Mesa. The whole island below you - and a palisade of poles a little way off. The gang's back door.
prop fortgate zone.id=fortgate
prop fortgate zone.radius=7
prop fortgate zone.message=The gang's fort - and the hounds come pouring out of it, a huge one at their head!
prop watchtowerzone zone.id=watchtower
prop watchtowerzone zone.radius=4
prop watchtowerzone zone.message=The fort's watchtower. Sundown is a scatter of roofs far below, by the sea.
prop homeward zone.id=homeward
prop homeward zone.radius=8
prop homeward zone.message=The foot of the mesa. Somebody rode out from town and nailed a notice to the signpost.
prop bankzone zone.id=bank
prop bankzone zone.radius=5
prop bankzone zone.message=The Bank of Sundown: a teller's counter, a letter behind it, and the vault door at the back.
