prop canyondust zone.radius=45
prop wind sound.event=event:/amb/caravan
prop wind sound.volume=0.5
prop wind zone.radius=50

quest title=The New Sheriff
quest intro=A frontier town under red canyons, its sheriff gone after an outlaw gang. Her report is on the jail's desk. Start at the wharf.
# Chapter 1 - Sundown
step reach|wharf|1|Tie up at Sundown's wharf
step read|Sheriff's last report|1|Read the sheriff's last report on the jail's desk
step read|Wanted poster|1|Read the wanted poster by the saloon's door
step collect|story:sheriffkey|1|Find the sheriff's key ring in her desk drawer
step open|Sheriff's gun locker|1|Open the sheriff's gun locker with her keys
step reach|ranch|1|Take the east trail out to the Double Bar ranch
# Chapter 2 - the ranch
step read|Rancher's letter|1|Read the rancher's letter in the ranch house
step open|Barn tack chest|1|Open the barn's tack chest for the ranch's net launcher
step catch|Llama|3|Round up the three rustled llamas in the box canyon
step open|Rancher's strongbox|1|Open the rancher's strongbox - his thanks and the map of the gang's trail
step reach|station|1|Back in Sundown, go to the railway station and follow the rails up the canyon
# Chapter 3 - the railroad
step reach|derailment|1|Find the derailed silver train in the canyon
step read|Engineer's log|1|Read the engineer's log in the wrecked engine's cab
step collect|story:dynamite|2|Find two sticks of dynamite: under the tool car's seat and at the section house
step open|Express car safe|1|Blow the express car's safe with a stick of dynamite
step reach|trestle|1|Reach the blown trestle over the canyon river
step kill|Angler fish|1|Face the thing in the river pool under the trestle
step open|Fallen strongbox|1|Dive for the strongbox that fell with the trestle
# Chapter 4 - the mine
step reach|mine|1|Climb the switchbacks to the Lucky Strike mine
step read|Foreman's tally board|1|Read the foreman's tally board at the mine's mouth
step kill|Bear|1|Drive the bear out of the mine's lower gallery
step collect|story:liftkey|1|Blow the foreman's strongbox open for the lift key
step reach|mesatop|1|Ride the mine's lift up through Black Mesa
# Chapter 5 - the fort
step reach|fortgate|1|Find the gang's fort on the mesa's top
step kill|Hyena|5|Fight off the gang's hounds and their alpha
step read|Gang's ledger|1|Read the gang's ledger in their cabin
step open|Gang's loot chest|1|Open the gang's loot chest
step reach|watchtower|1|Climb the fort's watchtower
step collect|story:allclear|1|Light the signal fire to tell the town the gang is gone
step reach|homeward|1|Climb down the mesa's ladder trail to the signpost at its foot
step read|Mayor's proclamation|1|Read the mayor's proclamation nailed to the signpost
# Chapter 6 - the bank
step collect|story:silverbar|6|Carry all six silver bars: the express safe, the river, the gang's chest
step reach|bank|1|Walk into the Bank of Sundown
step collect|story:receipt|1|Return the silver at the teller's counter
step read|Bank manager's letter|1|Read the bank manager's letter behind the counter
step open|Bank vault|1|Open the bank vault with the gang's key
step blueprint|Blueprint_BatteryCharger|1|Take the battery charger plans from the bank vault
step blueprint|Blueprint_DetailPlank|1|Take the decorative plank plans from the bank vault
step blueprint|Blueprint_Recycler|1|Take the recycler plans from the bank vault
quest done=The silver is home, the gang is gone and the vault is open. Sundown's church bell is still ringing - for its new sheriff.
quest reward=Plank*12;Leather*4;Cooked_GenericMeat*4

# --- A Raft store on the edge of Sundown: the general store, still trading (Raft's goods, and plans the crew missed) --
store generalstore at -116 -20 ground

# Buried treasure (one of the story line's last islands): titanium ore on top of Raft's own treasure loot - the metal detector finds it, the shovel digs it
call treasure x=0 z=0 r=70 n=1 seed=8812
prop treasure8812 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*3

save Sundown Canyons
